# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# chthonic-archive .gitignore — DENYLIST model (inverted 2026-06-06)
#
# Track by default. Turn OFF only the heavy / derived / external folders below.
# Replaces the prior "* + !whitelist" model, which ignored everything and forced
# a new ! for every real file — masking the repo. A denylist tells the truth by
# default: a new source file tracks because it exists, not because someone
# remembered to allow it.
#
# WARNING: this repo auto-pushes on commit and spans ~158 GB incl. satellites,
# build dirs, and model weights. The patterns below ARE the large-file seatbelt
# the bare `*` used to be. Keep weights / build / deps / satellites turned off.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Satellites — NTFS junctions to SEPARATE repos. Never tracked from here. ──
csb-live/
eoai-live/
git-dump-live/
pnk-lfh-live/
pnk-live/
poisontr33s-live/
rmco-live/

# ── Nested repo copies / goldens (full trees — not tracked recursively) ──
chthonic-archive/
chthonic-golden/

# ── Local tool homes / version managers at root (external, huge — not content) ──
.cargo/
rv/
ruby-zjit/
.gemini/
.continue/

# ── Build artifacts ──
target/
**/target/
build/
**/build/
dist/
**/dist/
out/
**/out/
.next/
**/.next/
*.spv

# ── Dependencies / vendored ──
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
.venv/
**/.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
**/vendor/
**/.bundle/
mas_mcp/uv.lock
extensions/*/.chthonic/python/uv.lock
extensions/*/bun.lock

# ── Caches ──
.cache/
**/.cache/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.fastembed_cache/
.cocoindex_code/
/.cocoindex_code/

# ── Model weights & large binaries (the large-file seatbelt) ──
*.safetensors
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.h5
*.gguf
*.onnx
*.msgpack
*.npz
*.npy
*.engine
*.vsix
models/
adapters/
**/checkpoints/

# ── Databases / operational state ──
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db
*.db-journal
*-wal
*-shm
manifest/sessions/
manifest/sonic_window_history.ndjson
dev/dealogue-fayde/*.db
dev/dealogue-fayde/.bundle/

# ── Editor / IDE / OS ──
.vs/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp

# ── Secrets ──
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
gha-creds-*.json

# ── App-specific (preserved from prior file) ──
apps/chthonic-next/.next/
apps/chthonic-next/node_modules/
apps/chthonic-next/package.json
apps/chthonic-tensor-bridge/build/
apps/chthonic-tensor-bridge/node_modules/
apps/flux-engine-forge/scratch/
apps/flux-engine-forge/.venv/
apps/flux-satellite/engines/
extensions/*/media/wasm/pkg/
extensions/*/.chthonic/venv/
extensions/*/.chthonic/cache/
extensions/*/.chthonic/python/.venv/
extensions/*/.chthonic/ruby/vendor/
extensions/*/.chthonic/ruby/.bundle/*
extensions/*/.chthonic/rust-target/
extensions/*/native/target/
extensions/*/node_modules/

# ── Dumpster-dive operational (preserved) ──
dumpster-dive/corpse-vault/
dumpster-dive/intake/overnight-daemon/*/classifications/
dumpster-dive/intake/overnight-daemon/*/report.json
dumpster-dive/intake/overnight-daemon/*/report.md
dumpster-dive/intake/overnight-daemon/*/run.json
dumpster-dive/intake/overnight-daemon/*/.keep
dumpster-dive/intake/overnight-daemon/*.log
dumpster-dive/intake/embeddings/ore_embeddings_*.json
dumpster-dive/forge/furnace/csharp/bin/
dumpster-dive/forge/furnace/csharp/obj/

# ── Misc (preserved) ──
.mas_mcp/
mcp_fs_root/
book/
claude/stewardess/
codex/mailbox/.tmp_fixture_eval/
codex/mailbox/.tensor_debug/
scripts/_*.py
*.off
**/NUL
**/NUL.*

# ── Heavy data / output / external-clone dirs (sized in the 2026-06-06 re-assessment) ──
# error-classifier 326M · meta-ide 268M (external SDK clones) · data 189M
# artifacts 27M · bun-playwright-poc 23M · *.bak incl corpus.sqlite.bak 49M
# (gitignore has NO inline comments — patterns must be bare, one per line)
error-classifier/
meta-ide/
data/
artifacts/
bun-playwright-poc/
unsloth_compiled_cache/
logs/
*.bak
